  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the area, in square inches, of a rectangle with a length of <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math> inches and a width of <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math> inches?</p>",
